# ==============================================================================
# ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES TEMPLATE (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# IMPORTANT SECURITY RULE:
# This project is a client-side Vite Single-Page Application (SPA).
# Any variable prefixed with `VITE_` is INJECTED directly into client JavaScript
# and is visible to ANYONE who inspects the website in DevTools.
#
# ❌ NEVER PUT PRIVATE SECRETS HERE (e.g. Stripe secret keys, database passwords,
#    AWS secret keys, private OAuth secrets).
# 
# ✔️ ONLY PUT PUBLIC CONFIGURATION (e.g. public contact endpoints, public analytics IDs)
# ==============================================================================

# Contact Form / Notification Webhook (Optional)
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your_form_id

# Public Site URL
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://yourportfolio.com
